# Source screenshots for the hero. The app serves public/hero/*.webp, which is
# the same 12 photographs at 340kB for the set instead of 4.2MB. Keeping the
# originals out of the repo stops 4MB of unused images being deployed and
# served publicly. They remain on disk locally; re-optimise from them if the
# hero art ever changes.
public/pics/
